8-31T05:00:00.000Z", "registration-end-time": "2026-10-02T05:00:00.000Z", "registration-url": "https://events.vtools.ieee.org/event/register/575012", "survey-url": "", "cost": false, "max-registrations": null, "cancelled": false, "uid": "FC252362-9641-4373-9263-639551135ACE", "publish": true, "virtual": true, "link": "https://events.vtools.ieee.org/m/575012", "ieee-attending": null, "guests-attending": null, "created-at": "2026-08-31T02:25:52.000Z", "updated-at": "2026-09-16T03:16:58.000Z", "pricing": null, "speakers": null, "media": null, "enhanced-report": null}, {"id": 561590, "title": "GEITEC 2026 – VIII International Conference on Technology, Engineering and Innovation Management", "description": "<div class=\"ahS2Le\">\r\n<div class=\"F9yp7e ikZYwf LgNcQe\" dir=\"auto\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2846\">The VIII International Conference GEITEC 2026 is an academic and professional event focused on science, technology, engineering and innovation management. The 2026 edition will be held in Panama City, Panama, from November 12 to 14, 2026.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"3224\">GEITEC 2026 aims to provide a space for the exchange of research results, applied experiences, methodological approaches and institutional initiatives related to technology management, innovation systems, technology transfer, strategic foresight, technological surveillance, sustainable design, circular economy, data science and artificial intelligence applied to innovation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3538\">The conference is addressed to researchers, professors, graduate students, professionals, innovation managers, technology transfer officers, entrepreneurs, policymakers and representatives of public and private organizations interested in strengthening innovation capabilities in Latin America and Ibero-America.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3540\" data-end=\"3776\">The event will include paper presentations, keynote lectures, thematic sessions, academic networking activities and spaces for collaboration among universities, research centers, companies, public institutions and innovation ecosystems.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3818\">Official website: <strong data-start=\"3796\" data-end=\"3818\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"http://www.geitec2026.org\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3816\">www.geitec2026.org</a></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>", "start-time": "2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z", "end-time": "2026-11-14T19:00:00.000Z", "time-zone": {"name": "America/Guatemala", "utc-offset": -6}, "primary-host": {"spoid": "CH09441", "name": "Peru Section Chapter, TEM14", "class_code": "SUBT", "class_description": "Technical SPO", "type_code": "CHPT", "type_description": "Chapter", "section_spoids": "R90721", "region_spoids": "R9", "society_spoids": "TEM014"}, "cohosts": [], "header": "<div class=\"ahS2Le\">\r\n<div class=\"F9yp7e ikZYwf LgNcQe\" dir=\"auto\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"cBGGJ OIC90c\" dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>", "footer": "", "keywords": "#Innovation Management #TechnologyManagement #TechnologyTransfer #StrategicForesight #TechnologicalSurveillance #ArtificialIntelligence #DataScience #CircularEconomy #SustainableDesign #EngineeringManagement #LatinAmerica #Ibero-America", "tags": ["#Innovation", "#Management", "#TechnologyManagement", "#TechnologyTransfer", "#StrategicForesight", "#TechnologicalSurveillance", "#ArtificialIntelligence", "#DataScience", "#CircularEconomy", "#SustainableDesign", "#EngineeringManagement", "#LatinAmerica", "#Ibero-America"], "agenda": "<p data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4527\"><strong data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4527\">Day 1 &ndash; Nove